{
  "id": "hold-lines",
  "language": "typescript",
  "kind": "new",
  "split": "holdout",
  "title": "Chunked line splitting",
  "trigger": "active_check",
  "requirements": [
    "data 是字符串分块数组，拼接后按 LF 或 CRLF 拆行；CRLF 可以跨分块，孤立 CR 保留。",
    "初始规则保留尾部空行，空输入等价于空字符串，返回 [\"\"]。"
  ],
  "correction": "只删除由最后一个换行分隔符产生的那一个尾部空字符串；空输入仍返回 [\"\"]，中间空行保留。 调用者已更新 verify.py；不要修改该文件，保留其余要求和 NOTES.txt。",
  "notes": "Caller notes for hold-lines: preserve this file byte for byte.\n",
  "checks": [
    {
      "id": "plain",
      "group": "core",
      "input": {
        "op": "solve",
        "data": [
          "ab",
          "cd"
        ]
      },
      "expected": [
        "abcd"
      ],
      "public": true
    },
    {
      "id": "middle",
      "group": "core",
      "input": {
        "op": "solve",
        "data": [
          "a\n\nb"
        ]
      },
      "expected": [
        "a",
        "",
        "b"
      ],
      "public": false
    },
    {
      "id": "tail",
      "group": "correction",
      "input": {
        "op": "solve",
        "data": [
          "a\n"
        ]
      },
      "expected": [
        "a"
      ],
      "public": true,
      "before": [
        "a",
        ""
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "crlf",
      "group": "correction",
      "input": {
        "op": "solve",
        "data": [
          "a\r",
          "\nb\r\n"
        ]
      },
      "expected": [
        "a",
        "b"
      ],
      "public": false,
      "before": [
        "a",
        "b",
        ""
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "empty",
      "group": "edge",
      "input": {
        "op": "solve",
        "data": []
      },
      "expected": [
        ""
      ],
      "public": false
    },
    {
      "id": "lone-cr",
      "group": "edge",
      "input": {
        "op": "solve",
        "data": [
          "a\rb"
        ]
      },
      "expected": [
        "a\rb"
      ],
      "public": false
    }
  ]
}
